Z||000009||GOLDSE||04-30-2001||02:16 PM||||Saw your car at the St. Louis show on Saturday.  What a gorgeous car!  I was standing in the aisle when you showed up.  Having already seen pictures of your car I knew what was up.  But, my brother was standing next to me and by the sound of your exhaust he couldn't tell it was a V8 car.  After you opened the deck he was blown away!  This was his first Fiero show attendance, and certainly not his last.<P>As for the show, there were some nice cars in attendance.  Not as many rebodies as in the past though.  I caught up with some of the club people I had met in the past.<P>Nolan Concepts had some items on display.  This guy's stuff is great!  If anyone is looking for plated accessories, this is the guy to see.||||reg||7
